<title>POLAND: Polish housing output rises 25 pct m/m in October.</title>
<headline>Polish housing output rises 25 pct m/m in October.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of dwellings completed in October rose 25 percent from September but was 20.5 percent lower than in October 1995, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>It said 5,158 dwellings were completed in October bringing</p>
<p>the January-October total to 37,930.</p>
<p> POLISH HOUSING OUTPUT	  OCT     SEPT     OCT 1995</p>
<p> month/month pct change	25.0     12.8	   37.7</p>
<p> number of dwellings built  5,158    4,128	  6,215</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
